<title>USA: Freeport-McMoRan Oil again omits payout.</title>
<headline>Freeport-McMoRan Oil again omits payout.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freeport-McMorRan Oil and Gas Royalty Trust said Tuesday there will be no distribution for August 1997.</p>
<p>The trust last paid a dividend in October 1995.</p>
<p>The trust's Class A costs for the month of August exceeded gross proceeds by $1,212,386, increasing the cumulative Class A cost carry-forward to $10,068,966, it said.</p>
<p>In addition, net current month trust administrative expenses of $55,073 will be paid from the trust administrative expense reserve, resulting in approximately $1.8 million remaining in the expense reserve.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1700))</p>
